            "slot": "s683",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Let’s get real – Wrinkles are an inevita",
            "text": "Let’s get real – Wrinkles are an inevitable part of the natural aging process… Concern about the formation of deeper, more pronounced facial lines is just as natural as the process itself. So what can we do to repair, restore, and fortify our faces? (The title might have given it away…)",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s686",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Wrinkles are an inevitable part of aging",
            "text": "<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Wrinkles are an inevitable part of aging. Like many, you may find yourself tracing your fingertips along those facial lines imagine you could erase. In the process the question inevitably becomes what can I do to fill-in and eliminate – to literally renew my face?</span>",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s690",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Finding Your Secret Weapon",
            "text": "Finding Your Secret Weapon",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s693",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · When it comes to finding an effective so",
            "text": "<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">When it comes to finding an effective solution to address the look of aging – there are a myriad of choices – from this wrinkle cream to that – to all-out invasive procedures. The market is flooded with every imaginable anti-aging promise, from the homeopathic to the surgical. Finding the right “fix” can be confusing and intimidating – all you want is a product that delivers on its promise!</span>",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
